WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.504
SEE. Highlight the eyes watching a ball.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.739
HEAR. Show ears detecting a bell or voice.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:10.909
MOVE. Illustrate legs moving and hands catching.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:15.805
COOPERATE. Connect eyes, ears and limbs in a safe reaction.
